flowchart LR
  tx[Listing transaction] --> outbox[(outbox_events)]
  outbox --> dispatcher[Outbox dispatcher]
  dispatcher --> queue[platform-events queue]
  queue --> projector[Search projector]
  projector --> read[Read canonical listing + category + region + org]
  read --> normalize[Normalize Unicode, bilingual fields, pinyin/synonyms, geo]
  normalize --> version{Event version >= indexed version?}
  version -- No --> drop[Drop stale event]
  version -- Yes --> index[(OpenSearch public-content-vN)]
  index --> alias[public-content alias]
  alias --> query[Search API]
  query --> rank[Text relevance + proximity + freshness + quality]
  rank --> sponsored[Insert clearly labeled sponsored slots]
  sponsored --> response[Facets + cursor results]
  dead[Dead-letter queue] <-- retries exhausted --> projector
  reconcile[Nightly reconciliation] --> read
